    mscp:description "Part of the Food and Agriculture Organization of the United Nations (FAO), AIMS is a community of experts in agricultural information and data management from around the world. It provides an open and free space for communication and the exchange of ideas, suggestions, questions, and solutions around the core areas of Information and Data Access Services, information and data management open standards, technology, and methodologies." ;
