msc:m9 a msct:m ;
    mscp:description "<p>A body of standards, including a glossary of terms (in other contexts these might be called properties, elements, fields, columns, attributes, or concepts) intended to facilitate the sharing of information about biological diversity by providing reference definitions, examples, and commentaries.</p><p>Sponsored by Biodiversity Information Standards (TWDG), the current standard was last modified in October 2009.</p>" ;
    mscp:keywords <http://rdamsc.bath.ac.uk/thesaurus/subdomain235>,
